# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real key.
# Billed separately from Claude Pro/Max: prepaid credits at console.anthropic.com, with a spend limit.
#
# Used by Memtegrity's AI judge (Block 4). It looks for this file in two places, in order:
#   1. the plugin's data folder (~/.claude/plugins/data/<plugin id>/.env; survives plugin updates)
#   2. the plugin root (this repository, when testing with --plugin-dir)
# The key is passed to the API client directly and never exported, so Claude Code itself keeps
# using your subscription. Without a key, or with MEMTEGRITY_JUDGE=off, Memtegrity uses rules only.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
